    "Acquire the necessary intermediate skills to take dictation at speeds ranging up to 160 words per minute. The certificate is designed for intermediate level work in machine shorthand. This certificate will provide the students with stenographic skills that are applicable to non-court work specifically in law offices transcribing attorney briefs, general office work where dictated material needs to be transcribed, medical transcription, and other settings where recordation of meetings needs to be transcribed. These skills are necessary to seek employment as a transcriptionist."
